OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits asylum seeker hotel
OL,4,Apetrol bomb attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted throwing a petrol
OL,7,Fbomb at a hotel used to house asylum
OL,8,Fseekers in Islington, north London.
OL,10,FMark Neville, 65, who pleaded guilty to
OL,11,Fattempted arson when he appeared at
OL,12,FSnaresbrook Crown Court on Wednesday,
OL,13,Fwas captured on CCTV carrying out the
OL,14,Fattack at Thistle City Barbican in
OL,15,FDingley Road on 24 September 2025.
OL,17,FThe fire was discovered shortly before
OL,18,F23:00 BST and was put out by security
OL,19,Fguards. It did not cause any injuries.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
