OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits asylum seeker hotel
OL,4,Apetrol bomb attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Paul Ridley said the attack
OL,7,Fwas "designed to terrify residents and
OL,8,Fthe local community", and that Neville
OL,9,Fhad been "motivated by hate."
